====================================================
==              SarconDesktop Portfolio            ==
====================================================

📁 PROJECT NAME:
   SarconDesktop — Retro Portfolio Website

🖥️ DESCRIPTION:
   An interactive retro-style web portfolio that mimics
   a classic computer desktop environment. Each desktop
   icon opens a draggable and resizable window, allowing
   users to explore the developer’s profile, works, and
   contact information.

⚙️ FEATURES:
   - Retro desktop interface with draggable .exe windows
   - Functional lock screen with real-time clock and date
   - Dynamic window system (open, minimize, maximize, close)
   - Contact form integrated with EmailJS
   - Responsive layout for desktop and mobile
   - Taskbar with live time display

💻 TECHNOLOGIES USED:
   - HTML5
   - CSS3
   - JavaScript (ES6)
   - EmailJS API
   - Google Fonts (Pixelify Sans)
   - Custom Icons & Wallpaper Assets

📂 MAIN FILES:
   - index.html   → Main structure
   - Main.css     → Styling and layout
   - Main.js      → Window logic and EmailJS integration

📨 EMAILJS SETUP:
   1. Initialize EmailJS with your public key:
      emailjs.init("YOUR_PUBLIC_KEY");
   2. Use your own service_id and template_id in:
      emailjs.send("service_id", "template_id", {...});

🚀 HOW IT WORKS:
   1. User clicks “Log In” to unlock the desktop.
   2. Clicking desktop icons opens .exe windows.
   3. Windows can be dragged, maximized, or closed.
   4. Contact.exe sends messages via EmailJS.


